{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11412010","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11412010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1141201001:1":{"text":"Hey! I haven't had a chance to ask until now... So, who stole my necklace?","source_cn":"对了对了，有件事我一直没问呢，之前偷走我项链的小偷到底是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x100D0B14F20F4DB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1141201001":{"text":"Hey! I haven't had a chance to ask until now... So, who stole my necklace?","source_cn":"对了对了，有件事我一直没问呢，之前偷走我项链的小偷到底是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x100D0B14F20F4DB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141201002:1":{"text":"Never heard of him...","source_cn":"完全没听过的名字……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E64F9FB5374BD08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1141201003:1":{"text":"That's right. A glib-tongued ginger.","source_cn":"没错，是一个满身橙红色毛发，油嘴滑舌的家伙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA29B0B40676DF89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1141201004:1":{"text":"Believe it or not, Odie ain't all bad.","source_cn":"他其实不是个完全的混蛋，我是说那个阿德。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FA77290D8F3FAA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141201005:1":{"text":"Uncle Walker, you know him?","source_cn":"瓦尔克大叔，你认识他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23AB168DA4AB354B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1141201006:1":{"text":"We met before and shared a few drinks. He's quite talkative.","source_cn":"见过几次，他很健谈，我们一起喝过几杯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD47F9CD6C55584B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1141201007:1":{"text":"I don't mind telling you a story I saw if you're interested. Alkali ain't got no room for nobodies like Odie so you won't hear this tale elsewhere.","source_cn":"你们要是想知道阿德的事，说点倒也无妨，不过，这可不是什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1118D6541CA073DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1141201008:1":{"text":"A few months ago, a blind man came to Alkali.","source_cn":"几个月前的某天，咸水镇来了一个盲人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x859018808396DB53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1141201009:1":{"text":"A quest got posted on the board with a mighty fine reward, looking for a missing daughter.","source_cn":"很快，告示栏贴出了一个天价赏金的任务，寻找丢失的女儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59985BD1B0179ECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1141201010:1":{"text":"Alkali sees plenty folks driftin' through each day. More bounty hunters than quests most times. But this missing daughter job was different.","source_cn":"咸水镇每天都人来人往，但赏金猎人总比委托人要多，简单优...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x024B7A39F009D34D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1141201010":{"text":"Alkali sees plenty folks driftin' through each day. More bounty hunters than quests most times. But this missing daughter job was different.","source_cn":"咸水镇每天都人来人往，但赏金猎人总比委托人要多，简单优渥的任务总是很快就被拿下，但唯独这个找女儿的任务，一直没人接。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x024B7A39F009D34D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1141201011:1":{"text":"Bounty hunters are well informed. They all knew it was from that blind man, who ain't got deep pockets.","source_cn":"赏金猎人的情报灵通的很，大家都知道寻人委托是那个盲人托...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4544DF49908F72BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1141201012:1":{"text":"Even if he once had a fortune, a man with no eyesight simply wouldn't be able to hold on to his wealth in Alkali.","source_cn":"就算曾经有钱，一个盲人，在咸水镇，他也很难守住自己的财产。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAE72A773B71F971","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1141201013:1":{"text":"As we all settled in to watch the show, that ginger-headed Odie took up the quest.","source_cn":"就在大家都看笑话的时候，那个红毛小子——阿德，竟然接了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA618871115E13EE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1141201013":{"text":"As we all settled in to watch the show, that ginger-headed Odie took up the quest.","source_cn":"就在大家都看笑话的时候，那个红毛小子——阿德，竟然接了这个任务。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA618871115E13EE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1141201014:1":{"text":"Ha-ha. Everyone thought the same thing.","source_cn":"是啊，哈哈，所有人都这么想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B889D4C933969E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1141201015:1":{"text":"But Odie set out with no advance payment; he actually spent quite a bit of his own stash. We all thought he was crazy.","source_cn":"但阿德上路了。没有任何定金，自己还搭了钱，我们都说，那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1499D29D52BD65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1141201016:1":{"text":"Several weeks later, he came back, downcast. Guess he'd blown his last penny lookin' for that girl.","source_cn":"几个星期后，他回来过一趟，沮丧得不像话，看样子是花光了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84098D1FB5513159","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1141201016":{"text":"Several weeks later, he came back, downcast. Guess he'd blown his last penny lookin' for that girl.","source_cn":"几个星期后，他回来过一趟，沮丧得不像话，看样子是花光了资金也没找到人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84098D1FB5513159","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1141201017:1":{"text":"He began selling his belongings, stealing, and scamming travelers. Eventually, he scraped together enough coin for a kit, and off he went.","source_cn":"后来啊，阿德那小子开始变卖自己的小玩意，开始偷，开始骗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2947F55E97C08994","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1141201018:1":{"text":"Few days after, he came back, battered and bruised, with a young'un on his back.","source_cn":"几天后，那小子伤痕累累的回来了，背上多了一个女孩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x325A78A287C8C5C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1141201018":{"text":"Few days after, he came back, battered and bruised, with a young'un on his back.","source_cn":"几天后，那小子伤痕累累的回来了，背上多了一个女孩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x325A78A287C8C5C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1141201019:1":{"text":"This is definitely unusual for missing person quests, but he did it. The whole of Alkali was touched when the father and daughter finally got back together.","source_cn":"当然，这在寻人任务里可不多见，他做到了。那对父女相聚的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50F7F02B910FDB59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1141201020:1":{"text":"The blind man gave him the promised chest of coin. I saw with my own eyes that all the gold inside was fake... Odie took his reward without a word.","source_cn":"盲人最终付了钱，我看到箱子里装的全是被人掉包过的假币…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA5B1AB270155344","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1141201021:1":{"text":"This Odie... Is he a good man or not?","source_cn":"这个阿德，到底是好人还是坏人呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDF7C13CFCDE542B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1141201022:1":{"text":"Good, bad... It's not all black or white in Alkali. Real life ain't a fairy tale. Pure good and pure evil ain't real.","source_cn":"好人，坏人。\\n咸水镇并不是非黑即白的，生活跟童话不一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x765A21FD5437E7DD","variant_status":"","male":"","fem